100 0 obj
<</AP<</N 273 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 14 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK<<>>/P 17 0 R /Rect[ 650.26001 974.71301 1653.82996 1088.81995]/Subtype/Widget/T(Vision)/Type/Annot/V(The purpose of the project is to migrate the old infrastructure to a new and improved enviorment. This change will bring a positive impact in the lives of both employees and customers.)>>
endobj
101 0 obj
<</AP<</N 276 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 14 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK<<>>/P 17 0 R /Rect[ 34.3689 118.239998 402.80399 714.88397]/Subtype/Widget/T(Target Group)/Type/Annot/V(The target groups for the project are the employees of the company and the customers that come to the park.\r\nThese groups will both benefit from the modernization of the management systems.)>>
endobj
102 0 obj
<</AP<</N 279 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 14 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK<<>>/P 17 0 R /Rect[ 441.297 120.989998 822.104 714.88397]/Subtype/Widget/T(Needs)/Type/Annot/V(The product solves the problem of outdated inftastructure and software \(Dutch-only management and reservation systems, lack of centralization\)\r\nThe product will significantly improve the user's experience.)>>
endobj
103 0 obj
<</AP<</N 294 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 14 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK<<>>/P 17 0 R /Rect[ 863.34698 119.614998 1241.40002 694.263]/Subtype/Widget/T(Product)/Type/Annot/V(The product consists of an overall improvement of already existing services and infrastructure.\r\n\r\nThese improvements include:\r\n    HRM Software\r\n    Accounting Software\r\n    Online Reservation System\r\n    Barrier Management System\r\n    Guest WiFi Implementation\r\n    Central File Server\r\n    Centralized Domain Controller\r\n    Backup System\r\n\r\nIt will be feasible to develop the product taking into consideration our team's experitse.\r\n)>>
endobj
104 0 obj
<</AP<</N 312 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 14 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK<<>>/P 17 0 R /Rect[ 1284.02002 122.364998 1645.57996 709.38501]/Subtype/Widget/T(Business Goals)/Type/Annot/V(The product intends so streamline the company's operations and save money and time in the long run.\r\n\r\nThe management systems will help make their operations more efficient, while the improved infrastructure will guarantee a more efficient and secure flow of traffic.\r\n\r\nMain Goals:\r\n\r\n   Centralize all ICT environments by migrating systems to a unified, cloud-based infrastructure, reducing redundant software by 30% within 3 months.\r\n\r\n   Implement SSO with Multi-Factor Authentication across all applications, ensuring 100% integration within 3 months.\r\n\r\n   Achieve full GDPR compliance by implementing security policies, conducting training within 3 months.\r\n\r\n   Deploy a cloud-based backup and disaster recovery solution to ensure 100% coverage of critical systems with a 1-hour recovery time within 3 months.\r\n\r\n)>>
endobj
